# FIRST ENCOUNTER LINES
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_0=§oAh, who do I see! An uninvited guest. But an expected one...
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_1=§oPeace be with you, sweetheart.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_2=§oIt must have been chance that brought you here. As it has many before you.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_3=§oBut you won't leave here empty-handed, believe me.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_4=§oLook, see these teeth? Take a closer look.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_5=§oFour objects. Four essences. Four materials.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_6=§oYou can take any one. Take it, and you'll learn a whole new craft.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_7=§oAnd yet, we must be honest with each other. At some point, you should come here and place the payment in my mouth. It's that simple.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_8=§oIf you listen closely to the received matter, you could hear a ticking sound. Like a clock. It's very convenient.
scene.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona.line_9=§oI'll hear that ticking from hundreds of chunks away, so don't forget to pay, dear. Just a heads up.

# INTERACTIONS
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_persona=§oThis object looks fragile... I should pick it up really carefully
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_brace=§oIt seems like there should be something else here...
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_tooth.pyrite=§oThe object is warm and solid to the touch. It shimmers in the light. Is it... metal?
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_tooth.velvet=§oThe object is soft and pleasant to the touch. It's made of something precious.
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_tooth.nacre=§oThe object emits a faint glow and has a perfectly cubic shape.
interaction.luxuriousmisfortunes.totem_tooth.porcelain=§oThe object is cold and hard. It should be something fragile...

# COMPLAINTS
complaint.luxuriousmisfortunes.gluttony=§oDisgusting, beggar's food! I need something more refined!